{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev40121","label":"COIN RUSH SHOWDOWN · Part 1"},"label":"Framing the Villain: B","stage":null,"prev":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_s","next":"event_coinrushshowdown1_06_s","speakers":{"sugar_b":"Sugar"},"icons":{"sugar_b":"si_c140_03_s"},"lines":[{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_1","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_1","text":"I keep my eyes fixed on the restaurant.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"CoinRushDrinkZone","bgArt":"coinrushdrinkzone","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_menu_realkindness","movie":null,"shown":["sugar_b","guilty_b","sin_b"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_2","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_2","text":"Although Sin seems a little uncomfortable, she's trying to get along with the others.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_3","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_3","text":"On the other hand, Guilty mostly listens, chiming in every once in a while.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_4","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_4","text":"To someone who doesn't know Guilty and Sin, they look just like two socially awkward people doing their best to fit in.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_5","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_5","text":"But in my eyes...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_6","text":"They look like they're trying a little too hard, don't they?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"CoinRushMainHall_expo","bgArt":"coinrushmainhall_expo","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_7","text":"Almost as if they're putting up with this on purpose, because they have an ulterior motive.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_8","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_8","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_9","text":"Just to be clear, I'm not suspicious of them... yet.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_10","text":"I mean, they seem to be getting along.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_11","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_11","text":"Yeah, it seems that way.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_12","text":"Even the maid army and the bunny girl army are going out of their way to socialize with Guilty and Sin.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_13","text":"Maybe they're trying to gauge if the two of them are truly the villains they're made out to be.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_14","text":"Or maybe they genuinely just want to be friends.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_15","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_15","text":"You're sending mixed signals here. So, should I be suspicious or not?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_16","text":"That's for you to decide.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_17","text":"Well, you know why I fell for you, Partner?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_18","text":"It's because you trust Nikkes unconditionally, almost to a fault.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_19","text":"Oh, and one more thing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_20","text":"There's a reason I think something fishy is going on.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_21","text":"The organizers are blatantly trying to paint Plan C as the bad guys.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_22","text":"I'm talking about the maliciously edited highlight reel and the way they publicly called them out on the broadcast.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_23","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_23","text":"... Honestly, I can't really argue with that. It's true that we were in the wrong.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_24","text":"Are you that distracted by all the bunny girls' butts that you can't see the bigger picture? I'm disappointed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_25","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_25","text":"... What?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_26","text":"Do you really think Sin was the only one who pulled a stunt like that in the first round, Tactical Maneuver?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_27","text":"There were plenty of others who did way worse things than that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_28","text":"Like tripping people up, giving them a sneaky shove,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_29","text":"or using the person ahead of them as a human shield.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_30","text":"A lot of them used the crowd as cover to pull dirty tricks.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_31","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_31","text":"Really?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_32","text":"Since I'm both security and part of the organizing team,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_33","text":"I can see the whole picture from a distance.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_34","text":"Same goes for the second round, Entertainment Coin Catch.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_35","text":"The moment they heard they had to collect coins, more than just a few people started attacking their competitors.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_36","text":"And I mean actual violence, not just the shockwaves Guilty created.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_37","text":"If it was obvious even to me, there's no way the other staff missed it...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_38","text":"much less the head of security.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_39","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_39","text":"So you think we're being targeted?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_40","text":"Without a doubt.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_41","text":"If all they wanted was a villain, they would have gone after the people who did worse things.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_42","text":"Instead, they went out of their way to single out Plan C for their antics. Of course, I'm not condoning their actions, so don't get me wrong.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_43","text":"They framed Plan C's relatively harmless stunts as some heinous crime.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_44","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_44","text":"So it's all deliberate.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_45","text":"Exactly. The question is whether they're deliberately targeting Plan C...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_46","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_46","text":"... or if they're targeting Missilis itself.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_47","text":"Who knows?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_48","text":"Either way, there's too little information to tell right now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_49","text":"I'll see if I can sweet-talk the security guards into telling me more.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_50","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_50","text":"Just to be sure, you're not using that as a euphemism for threatening them with a gun, right?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_51","text":"Of course not. I'm going to treat them to a nice cup of sugar coffee.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_52","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_52","text":"Um... yeah, sure. I guess that could work.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_05_e_53","text":"Give this whole thing some thought, Partner.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,